{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：21:28 2026-08-22 HKT</p>\n\n<p>一連兩場《古天樂MY FIRST SHOW》今晚（22日）來到尾場，到場欣賞古天樂（古仔）演唱會尾場的圈中人及名人包括廖子妤和媽媽、邱彥筒（Marf）和男友林家熙（Locker）、何超雲和男性友人、周秀娜、林建岳，狄波拉、傅明憲、吳家樂、謝安琪、樂易玲、何嘉莉、姚瑩瑩和兒子、張柏文與女性友人。</p>\n<p>古天樂在紅館中央半空現身演唱一曲〈世紀大騙案〉為演唱會揭開序幕。</p>\n<img alt=\"一連兩場《古天樂MY FIRST SHOW》今晚（22日）來到尾場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/23d70e4119d3b7304d8f775a8784cc6f/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_55_46_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《古天樂MY FIRST SHOW》今晚（22日）來到尾場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6e28c460c5e5993d69cbb9ac0480f1a6/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_27_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔建邦到場觀賞古天樂演唱會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1219f67ceb29ba0c5e700e5c87e2b88f/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_28_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張柏文到場觀賞古天樂演唱會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6d44234ff585155c6789da5818a466c5/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_28_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚瑩瑩和兒子到場觀賞古天樂演唱會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c251591ce1de882479928df881f22da6/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_29_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何超雲和男性友人到場觀賞古天樂演唱會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f55fc84b2a3393a6e52583c421c43369/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_30_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"邱彥筒和男友林家熙到場觀賞古天樂演唱會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cecbe8af6d718eaf3847ded97a811a85/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_31_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何嘉莉到場觀賞古天樂演唱會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/09a8089f8b5f5916c83c789f53e29982/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_34_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖子妤和媽媽到場觀賞古天樂演唱會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1b602cfb912b48efdc03491d963ba58c/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_35_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廖子妤媽媽罕公開露面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3e80d0db3fe498c0ef3eb64ac0d772f6/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_36_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲到場觀賞古天樂演唱會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6c58414efe7b9f1286d392443d760d1b/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_37_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"狄波拉到場觀賞古天樂演唱會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b1251858c66540bfaa9ceaa2767d92a3/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_38_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"狄波拉早前因前夫謝賢離世，神隱多時。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5269a67377a6b0e86d93fc70680a9d70/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_38_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"謝安琪到場觀賞古天樂演唱會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4579f92a343262375d28f39504b407e9/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_40_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林建岳到場觀賞古天樂演唱會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9e1ab007428a0e529f70bc75fc84485d/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_40_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"古天樂在紅館中央半空現身演唱一曲〈世紀大騙案〉為演唱會揭開序幕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1738d93b74b7c2aab44052493a33b5fd/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_42_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"古天樂在紅館中央半空現身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d4025c23ac6955481338d28b68a81ac8/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_44_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"古天樂走近觀眾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/11a93bcfa26e11ad89ed431f7d058207/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_46_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"古天樂開場跳唱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6cbbfcd0d5488a58c7b06bd1e7673298/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_46_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"古天樂開演唱會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9db278d0bbe8d464258d25a9fa97252c/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_48_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"古天樂又唱又跳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ad707c260ed61be1301ebaa7b1e68a8d/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_49_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"古天樂跳舞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e42dd0ccbee085fc611ace7aa84dec24/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_50_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"古天樂首次開紅館演唱會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/00867bd002d8ef7a3f57d5f11ea1915c/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_50_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"古天樂挑戰跳舞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5f25c86a9ffc8b929cd523b1ee8e0672/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_52_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"古天樂與女舞者跳貼身舞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/81d23232f57cb2fc365980071798b082/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_52_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"古天樂又唱又跳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8f42b2e1eef0c5399506ddc9b72fbdd8/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_56_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"古天樂尾場演唱會一樣有農夫做嘉賓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0eec7cf81d2fb806e544809157f3c8a9/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_58_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"農夫做嘉賓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/332994e05648d26153535b83fc08ecc2/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_59_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"農夫與古天樂合唱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4b6d7ef52c93de685814b7a22d8909a1/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_58_01_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>古天樂圈中好友贈花籃</h2>\n<p>而紅館後台亦擺滿多位圈中好友送上的花籃，當中包括：謝霆鋒、劉德華、成龍、張柏芝、容祖兒、何超蓮、古巨基、任達華、張智霖和袁詠儀、鄭中基、吳君如、陳山聰、林盛斌、陳靜、羅嘉良和蘇岩、楊千嬅和丁子高、梁詠琪、郭富城、張敬軒、任賢齊、杜德偉、蘇永康和老婆、草蜢、伍樂城、鄧麗欣、姜大衛和李琳琳、譚耀文、謝天華、羅浩銘、徐偉棟、林雪團隊、方力申、胡楓、杜琪峯、韋家輝、游奶海、朱淑儀、龔慈恩、林凱鈴、車婉婉、洪天明、張達倫、滕麗名、向華強夫婦、張繼聰和謝安琪等。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/25554a14e4840c7fc1c78a44a531d8b9/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_55_47_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7f1cc2c96979f146a2955a5e21b148cb/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_55_52_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3d1638ab43321025ccb750a67064b242/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_55_53_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6607a24f645ee59bb1c231fd023be1ec/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_55_53_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ed2c76f6cf0e2f346984b5f17993c6d0/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_55_54_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0de3e776dd380f3520eff5ef9b8626b7/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_55_54_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3dbcbeba175139547b4ecfe6f822c20c/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_56_00_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1f94faf0ed3cdd12347c769c8d49980a/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_56_00_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c53084dc5dd2a6db0900a7702eb2f1de/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_56_01_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4a6f80787c2f1d9abe7002618094b6eb/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_56_02_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/af8fbf7e3a47ace2aab96d23da38af4f/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_56_02_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cb6a61753fe9146156c02feb015c2026/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_56_59_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/35042efb44fff3d7e849a67572da70a6/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_00_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/74a7fa9d3ad3fbe9786b78d41a24e13a/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_01_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/89e99e0daa256218b115300125b7a917/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_01_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b3b5e3ce5c33028edb6829e3ef407e62/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_05_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/22f0694d39869ec848c66784a40a0451/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_8_57_06_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9511bc154040cdf8148f71940ce994